Track 1: Orion's Belt Is A Loose Stitch
- Story & Context: Elias discovered the vault’s leak after noticing water pooling near his guitar case, its icy temperature biting into his fingertips while he tracked the opening rhythm. He tried to seal the crack with pine resin, but the rising damp had already warped the ancient grain stored in the racks. "The stars are pulling through the ceiling today," he murmured, his voice caught in the 808’s steady, dry thump.
